::middesk ns
meta {
    doc: """
    Middesk business verification (KYB) bindings for agentic onboarding:
    create a business with the orders you need, wait for the
    `business.updated` webhook, read the report, then approve or reject.

    - `::middesk::businesses` creates, reads, lists and updates
      businesses, sets their status, and reads the review, policy
      results, timeline and PDF report
    - `::middesk::orders` adds products to a business (liens,
      litigations, bankruptcies, website and industry, KYC, ...)
    - `::middesk::documents` lists documents and downloads them as Bytes
    - `::middesk::monitoring` turns ongoing monitoring on and off
    - `::middesk::webhooks` verifies `X-Middesk-Signature-256`, parses
      events, and manages webhook endpoints
    - `::middesk::decisions` summarizes a business report into a compact
      record of what passed, what failed, the review tasks and a
      `needs-review` flag
    - `::middesk::api` holds the transport, page-number pagination and
      the `call` escape hatch

    **Setup**: context variables
    - `middesk.api.key`: a sandbox (`mk_test_...`) or production
      (`mk_live_...`) key. The key decides the host: `mk_test_` keys go to
      `api-sandbox.middesk.com`, `mk_live_` keys to `api.middesk.com`.
    - `middesk.env`: optional, `"sandbox"` or `"production"`, for keys
      without a recognizable prefix (a mismatch with the prefix is an Err)
    - `middesk.webhook.secret`: the secret you set on the webhook endpoint

    **Quick start**

    ```hot
    ::businesses ::middesk::businesses

    biz ::businesses/create-business({
      name: "Acme Robotics LLC",
      tin: {tin: "123410000"},
      addresses: [{address_line1: "123 Main St", city: "Austin", state: "TX", postal_code: "78701"}]
    })
    // ...wait for the business.updated webhook...
    report ::businesses/get-business(biz.id)
    ::middesk::decisions/summarize(report)
    ```
    """
}

ENVIRONMENTS
meta {
    doc: """Middesk base URLs by environment (no trailing slash). Keys only work against their own environment's host."""
}
{
  sandbox: "https://api-sandbox.middesk.com/v1",
  production: "https://api.middesk.com/v1"
}

DEFAULT_ENV "sandbox"

// Page size for the collect helpers.
DEFAULT_PER_PAGE 25
